@host = http://localhost:5299

### Seeded dev users: dev-requester, dev-customer, dev-specialist, dev-admin
GET {{host}}/api/dev/users

### Sign in (copy accessToken into @token below)
POST {{host}}/api/dev/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "user": "dev-requester" }

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Who am I
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Categories
GET {{host}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a category (duplicate names return the existing one with 200)
POST {{host}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Printing & scanning" }

### Raise a ticket
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "VPN disconnects every few minutes",
  "description": "Drops roughly every five minutes on home Wi-Fi.",
  "categoryId": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "priority": "Medium",
  "severity": "Moderate"
}

### My tickets
GET {{host}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ticket detail (404 if you cannot see it)
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Comment (isInternal is staff only)
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Still happening after a restart.", "isInternal": false }

###
@ticketId = paste-ticket-id-here

### Health
GET {{host}}/health
